          "message": {
            "text": "The browser launch is deliberately lazy and remains explicitly headless: an empty DPR list exercises only the source-pinned Chromium-roll discriminator and now records a not-launched producer marker, while the first real DPR still launches Chromium before any capture work. This changes no color-space model or non-empty evidence path; the pinned Blink FilterEffectBuilder transition behavior remains the authority.",
            "markdown": "The browser launch is deliberately lazy and remains explicitly headless: an empty DPR list exercises only the source-pinned Chromium-roll discriminator and now records a not-launched producer marker, while the first real DPR still launches Chromium before any capture work. This changes no color-space model or non-empty evidence path; the pinned Blink FilterEffectBuilder transition behavior remains the authority."
          },
